            "A stone of balance and harmony, said by tradition to combine the serenity of amethyst and the energy of citrine, to soothe while motivating and to help reconcile reason and intuition. It is associated with the solar plexus and crown chakras and the sign of Libra. Avoid prolonged strong sunlight, which can pale the amethyst; cleanse with water or smudging; recharge in moonlight."
